      "description": "Assinatura: colunas fixas em que o status reestiliza marcador, barra e situação.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-linha ds-nao\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-nm\">Acre</span><span class=\"ds-num\">4</span><span class=\"ds-barra\"><i style=\"width:50%;background:var(--ok)\"></i><i style=\"width:25%;background:var(--nc)\"></i><i style=\"width:25%;background:var(--esp)\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-sit\">1 de 4 não conformes</span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-linha{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(130px,1.2fr) 48px minmax(0,2.4fr) 152px;column-gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;min-height:46px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--fio-2);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;color:var(--tinta);text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s}.ds-linha:hover{background:var(--lavado)}.ds-linha:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--verde);outline-offset:2px}.ds-nm{font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}.ds-nm::before{content:'';width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--fio-forte)}.ds-nao .ds-nm::before{background:var(--nc)}.ds-num{text-align:right;color:var(--tinta-2);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-barra{display:flex;height:9px;background:var(--fio-2)}.ds-barra i{display:block}.ds-sit{text-align:right;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}.ds-nao .ds-sit{color:var(--nc)}"
